<title>USA: Coastal unit files for $100 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Coastal unit files for $100 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colorado Interstate Gas Co, a unit of Coastal Corp, filed Friday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $100 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
